- Produces: physical-stock records for Opoponax 40% nominal heterogeneous stock, provenance-corrected AIMI, Vetiveryl Acetate 10% w/w, Vetiver EO Haiti, Patchouli Light Oil, and concentration-unknown Hay Absolute.

