- [ ] **Step 3: Apply the minimal authority update**

Edit only the relevant inventory and registry records. Preserve unknown concentration, carrier, chemotype, and supplier fields as unknown rather than copying supplier-catalog defaults. Update generated registry/catalog records only for the changed stock ownership/status fields; do not regenerate unrelated material physics. Newly owned materials without validated MW/VP/ODT remain unavailable to strict pipeline dosing even though physical possession is recorded.

